  "analysis": "Both responses outline lanes, gates, reviews, and rollback plans, and they respect the constraints about dual approvals, costly CI, flaky audit checks, and irreversible key ingestion. VTT provides a more granular, step‑by‑step plan with explicit spec/ADR lane, feature‑flag mitigation, detailed verification steps (including the 5‑minute revocation test), clear handling of the Friday flake, and post‑deploy monitoring, which reduces ambiguity and follow‑up questions. NRQ is solid but less detailed on risk mitigation and integration sequencing.",
